Z||000000||Cozmo||10-09-2001||04:05 PM||||I'm putting a new engine in a friend's '86 GT.  We tried a new color combo for the plenum and valve cover stuff:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-371F.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-372F.JPG"> <BR>The block is hammertone black and the intake stuff is basecoat popsicle orange with topcoats of pearl Florida orange and pearl lumina yellow.  All the brackets are going to be hammertone silver and the engine compartment will be done with reflective insulation.  We'll use a black dist. cap with yellow (yes, all 7) wires.<BR>Eventually planning on Mr. Mikes charcoal seats with orange highlights and some subtle orange pinstriping and accents on the body.<BR>Should have the car together this weekend, definitely in time for halloween  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><B>BobC</B><BR><B>'85 2M6 Targa</B><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/targsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
